{
  "describes": "The deontic plane's nD system: the axes a deontic statement occupies when it is carried as coordinates (operator, Hohfeld incident, bearer, action, counterparty, condition, exception, negation), with the form-slot binding rules for a deontic claim. Published as data for any nD store (the versum reads it through the loomground.planes entry point); version equals the language version. Closed vocabularies equal vocabulary/operators.json and vocabulary/incidents.json (held equal by the test suite). Round 4: the plane's 5D binding (deontic.plane.binding()) is {} — operators are ought; the 5D describes what is; a norm's content enters 5D through the factual plane.",
  "id": "loomground-deontic",
  "namespace": "deontic",
  "version": "0.2.1",
  "axes": {
    "operator": {
      "value_type": "controlled_identifier",
      "vocabulary_mode": "closed",
